# GpxLoopSimilarityTest live output — versioned baseline snapshots use the
# `*-baseline.{json,md}` naming convention; the per-run `*-loop-similarity.*`
# files are overwritten by every test invocation and are not tracked.
docs/features/gpx-loop-similarity/*-loop-similarity.json
docs/features/gpx-loop-similarity/*-loop-similarity.md
docs/features/gpx-loop-similarity/Basel-*-baseline.json
docs/features/gpx-loop-similarity/Basel-*-baseline.md

# Internal investigation notes — the curated doc is docs/features/roundtrips.md
# (these patterns require a hyphen, so docs/features/roundtrips.md is NOT matched)
/docs/features/phase-2-*
/docs/features/roundtrip-*.md
/docs/features/roundtrip-*.json
/docs/features/kaiserstuhl-*.md
/docs/features/gpx-replay/
/docs/features/visual-analysis/

